1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,034
Most of us wait for a big moment to change our lives.

2
00:00:03,314 --> 00:00:07,127
But real progress rarely arrives in a single, dramatic leap.

3
00:00:07,407 --> 00:00:11,573
It grows quietly, through small choices repeated day after day.

4
00:00:11,853 --> 00:00:14,706
A page read before bed becomes a finished book.

5
00:00:14,986 --> 00:00:18,084
A short walk after lunch becomes a stronger body.

6
00:00:18,364 --> 00:00:23,411
And five minutes of English practice becomes a conversation you never expected to have.

7
00:00:23,691 --> 00:00:28,141
So instead of waiting for motivation, build a system you can return to.

8
00:00:28,421 --> 00:00:32,859
Start small, stay consistent, and let the ordinary do its work.

9
00:00:33,139 --> 00:00:36,302
You do not need a perfect morning or a brand new plan.

10
00:00:36,582 --> 00:00:41,068
You only need the next small step, and the willingness to take it again tomorrow.
